@startuml
!include style.iuml
left to right direction
actor "资料库所有者" as User
actor "系统入口" as OS
actor "外部 Agent\n扩展" as External
actor "模型运行时 / 提供方" as Provider
rectangle "PebblePile 叠石" {
  usecase "UC01 对话与记录" as U1
  usecase "UC02 整理标签、事件与证据" as U2
  usecase "UC03 管理记忆与偏好\n设置 / 回答旁依据" as U3
  usecase "UC04 跟进事项" as U4
  usecase "UC05 补记结果与体验" as U5
  usecase "UC06 纠正 / 停用 / 删除" as U6
  usecase "UC07 管理处理任务" as U7
  usecase "UC08 备份与恢复" as U8
  usecase "UC09 管理模型与授权" as U9
  usecase "UC10 浏览与整理记录库\n时间线 / 记录本 / 语义标签" as U10
  usecase "按范围查询有效上下文" as Query
  usecase "核对人物、时间与解释" as Check
}
User -- U1
User -- U3
User -- U4
User -- U5
User -- U6
User -- U7
User -- U8
User -- U9
User -- U10
User -- Check
OS -- U1
OS -- Query
External -- U1
External -- Query
External -- U5
Provider -- U2
Provider -- U4
U4 ..> Query : <<include>>
Check ..> U2 : <<extend>>\n[存在关键歧义]
note bottom of U1
记录先完成持久保存，整理按设置或本次请求启动。
对话、标签与进展回到同一记录。
end note
note bottom of External
访问按来源、人物和工具权限授权。
本人明确设置与删除使用独立权限。
end note
@enduml
